invariant: INV-46
file: src/mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the NEON noise interleaves the high halves of the bytes ahead of
  the low halves, so coefficients 2k and 2k + 1 of the first sixteen of
  each step trade places. Only an arm64 compiler reads the line, so the
  script builds bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for arm64 and runs it under
  qemu-aarch64. The lane skips without docker, and this then reports
  unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    int8x16_t first = vzip1q_s8(low, high);
--- new
    int8x16_t first = vzip1q_s8(high, low);
